Guide to create runs compatible with d4o

1. control run
CLM5_CMCC_d4o
DART_params_d4o.csh


2. soil moisture run
DART_params_d4o_sm.csh
CLM5_CMCC_d4o_sm

./CLM5_CMCC_d4o_sm

cd /work/cmcc/lg07622/land/work/template/d4o_sm
- need to fix  env_batch.xml for
<directive> -app spreads_filter </directive>

./case.submit

./CESM_DART_config

./xmlchange CONTINUE_RUN=TRUE

copy assimilate.csh from
/work/cmcc/lg07622/land/DART/models/clm/shell_scripts/cesm2_3/spreads/d4o
to not abort the code (line 119) due to the lack of observations (now read from d4o database)

copy input_nml_sm from 
/work/cmcc/lg07622/land/DART/models/clm/shell_scripts/cesm2_3/spreads/d4o
replacing input_nml
* adusjt the number of members accordingly

copy the following executables from the d4o compilation (e.g. /work/cmcc/lg07622/LDAS/spreads/d4o/flattened/clm)
clm_to_dart.dir/clm_to_dart
dart_to_clm.dir/dart_to_clm
fill_inflation_restart.dir/fill_inflation_restart
filter.dir/filter

the following bash files should also be copied from
/work/cmcc/lg07622/land/DART/models/clm/shell_scripts/cesm2_3/spreads/d4o
because the executables are now into the run direcory (instead of ../bld as before)
run_clm_to_dart.bash
run_dart_to_clm.bash
run_filter.bash
run_inflation.bash
run_dart_to_clm_snow.bash (if snow DA)

Observations must be first created at
/work/cmcc/lg07622/land/datain/d4o
and then copied into the run directory

./assimilate.csh /work/cmcc/lg07622/land/work/template/d4o_sm 0

SNOW DA

copy from /work/cmcc/lg07622/land/DART/models/clm/shell_scripts/cesm2_3/spreads/d4o
run_dart_to_clm_snow.bash into run
assimilate_snow.csh into ../run chagining to assimilate.csh
create run/tmp directory


